1
00:00:00,528 --> 00:00:02,028
(Amy:)Come on, Sheldon. Why not?

2
00:00:02,196 --> 00:00:04,736
(Sheldon:)For starters,
a bed-and-breakfast forces you

3
00:00:04,899 --> 00:00:07,879
(Sheldon:)-to eat with strangers at your table.
-One step ahead of you.

4
00:00:08,036 --> 00:00:09,746
(Amy:)Bernadette and Wolowitz
are going with us.

5
00:00:09,904 --> 00:00:12,284
(Sheldon:)Very well. What are
the sleeping arrangements?

6
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,980
(Sheldon:)We've only been dating
for three years.

7
00:00:15,143 --> 00:00:17,953
(Sheldon:)If we were to share a room,
people might talk.

8
00:00:19,314 --> 00:00:20,484
(Amy:)I got you your own room.

9
00:00:20,648 --> 00:00:22,488
(Sheldon:)What if my room has
a claw-toot bathtub?

10
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:25,490
(Amy:)It doesn't. I know it makes you feel
like you're bathing inside a monster.

11
00:00:27,221 --> 00:00:30,671
(Sheldon:)Look, I appreciate the effort,
but I'm still unclear

12
00:00:30,825 --> 00:00:33,995
(Sheldon:)how this trip is supposed
to be enjoyable for me.

13
00:00:34,162 --> 00:00:36,072
(Amy:)We're going to have
Valentine's Day dinner

14
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:39,840
(Amy:)on a fully functioning vintage train.

15
00:00:40,001 --> 00:00:42,671
(Sheldon:)Vintage? Be specific.

16
00:00:42,837 --> 00:00:45,007
(Amy:)An Alcoa FA-4
diesel locomotive

17
00:00:45,173 --> 00:00:47,453
(Amy:)leading a train
of meticulously restored

18
00:00:47,609 --> 00:00:50,109
(Amy:)1915 Pullman first-class coaches.

19
00:00:50,578 --> 00:00:52,178
(Sheldon:)Wow.

20
00:00:53,648 --> 00:00:55,488
(Sheldon:)I'm feeling the urge to hug you.

21
00:00:56,684 --> 00:00:59,184
(Sheldon:)And one... and two...

22
00:00:59,354 --> 00:01:02,194
(Sheldon:)All right, Gollum, we're good.

23
00:01:02,490 --> 00:01:04,330
I (THEME SONG) I

